{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Automate!",
    "steam_appid": 3408950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the CEO and factory manager, strive for efficiency by installing and upgrading a variety of equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your area, complete automated production lines, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn funds, optimize equipment placement, make improvements, unlock new facilities, and experience the limitless potential of automation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. <strong>Part Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading parts increases their resale value.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combinations</strong>: Unlock upgrades by combining specific parts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Packing</strong>: Boost product resale value with upgraded parts to maximize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrap</strong>: Even if you fail, you can recycle parts in the recycling box to earn money. Use resources efficiently!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. <strong>Shipping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship parts to generate revenue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part Insertion</strong>: Add parts to accumulate shipping value based on their price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earning Revenue</strong>: Interact with the shipping box to collect your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimizing Shipping Lines</strong>: Automate transport and use optimal routes to reduce labor costs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. <strong>Equipment Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment to improve productivity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Installing New Equipment</strong>: Introduce the latest machines to enhance production line efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong>: Update equipment to increase speed and functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimization</strong>: Rearrange equipment to build a more efficient production line.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. <strong>Facility Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand space and unlock special features.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Area Expansion</strong>: Invest funds to increase available space for operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Features</strong>: Unlock features like removing placement restrictions and further automating processes to boost logistics efficiency.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the CEO and factory manager, strive for efficiency by installing and upgrading a variety of equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your area, complete automated production lines, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn funds, optimize equipment placement, make improvements, unlock new facilities, and experience the limitless potential of automation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. <strong>Part Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading parts increases their resale value.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combinations</strong>: Unlock upgrades by combining specific parts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Packing</strong>: Boost product resale value with upgraded parts to maximize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrap</strong>: Even if you fail, you can recycle parts in the recycling box to earn money. Use resources efficiently!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. <strong>Shipping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship parts to generate revenue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part Insertion</strong>: Add parts to accumulate shipping value based on their price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earning Revenue</strong>: Interact with the shipping box to collect your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimizing Shipping Lines</strong>: Automate transport and use optimal routes to reduce labor costs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. <strong>Equipment Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment to improve productivity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Installing New Equipment</strong>: Introduce the latest machines to enhance production line efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong>: Update equipment to increase speed and functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimization</strong>: Rearrange equipment to build a more efficient production line.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. <strong>Facility Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand space and unlock special features.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Area Expansion</strong>: Invest funds to increase available space for operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Features</strong>: Unlock features like removing placement restrictions and further automating processes to boost logistics efficiency.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "As the CEO and factory manager, strive for efficiency by installing and upgrading a variety of equipment! Optimize equipment placement, make improvements, and unlock new equipment to experience the endless potential of automation!",
